      "content": "that makes sense. can you give me a more concrete example of how that looks in practice? like, if you had a situation where a group of white suburbanites was blocking a highway to protest a new tax, vs a group of black youths in a city center doing the same thing... how would the headlines and the \"vibe\" of the reporting actually differ in a typical news cycle?",
